  "title": "Our flight schedule is now open through April 2027",
  "summary": "Summer is here but 2027 winter and spring travel is calling.If escaping winter is already on your mind, you're in luck. Our schedule is now open through spring of 2027, making it easier than ever to start planning your next warm-weather getaway.We've extended our schedule through April 13, 2027, giving you plenty of time to lock in spring break plans, book your favorite winter escape, get your holiday travel squared away, or simply give yourself an adventure to look forward to.Our winter/spring",
